// ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
// sapphire_kv - REST API & Server Test 🔷
// Fayl: tests/test_main.zf
// ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
import std.net
import std.json
import "../src/store.zf" as store_mod

print("╔══════════════════════════════════════════════╗")
print("║  REST API & HTTP TESTLARI                    ║")
print("╚══════════════════════════════════════════════╝")

let test_db = store_mod.Store(json.parse("{}"), 0, 0, 0, "test_api.aof")
test_db.init("test_api.aof")

fn test_handler(req) {
    if req.path == "/ping" {
        return "PONG"
    }
    if req.path == "/set" {
        let b = req.body
        let body_obj = b
        try {
            body_obj = json.parse(b)
        } catch (e) {
            body_obj = b
        }
        let k = body_obj["key"]
        let v = body_obj["val"]
        let ttl = 0.0
        let ok = test_db.set(k, v, ttl)
        let res = json.parse("{}")
        res["saved"] = ok
        return json.stringify(res)
    }
    if req.path == "/get" {
        let q = req.query
        let v = test_db.get(q["key"])
        let res = json.parse("{}")
        res["val"] = v
        return json.stringify(res)
    }
    return "OK"
}

// Threaded fonda serverni ochamiz
let srv = net.listen(6389, test_handler, null, true)

// 1. PING testi
let ping = net.get("http://127.0.0.1:6389/ping")
if ping.body != "PONG" {
    print("XATO: /ping PONG qaytarmadi: " + ping.body)
    1 / 0
}
print("  ✓ /ping -> PONG muvaffaqiyatli!")

// 2. SET testi
let p = json.parse("{}")
p["key"] = "test:api"
p["val"] = "ZafiraREST"
let set_res = net.post("http://127.0.0.1:6389/set", p)
if set_res.status != 200 {
    print("XATO: /set status != 200")
    1 / 0
}
print("  ✓ /set -> 200 OK!")

// 3. GET testi
let get_res = net.get("http://127.0.0.1:6389/get?key=test:api")
let get_data = json.parse(get_res.body)
if get_data["val"] != "ZafiraREST" {
    print("XATO: /get qiymati mos kelmadi!")
    1 / 0
}
print("  ✓ /get?key=test:api -> ZafiraREST muvaffaqiyatli!")

net.close(srv)
print("🎉 Barcha REST API testlari 100% muvaffaqiyatli o'tdi!\n")
